            <ArticleTitle>Crystalline forms of 2,2,2-trifluoro-N-[(1R,2S)-1-{[1-(4-fluorophenyl)-1H-indazol-5-yl]oxy}-1-(3-methoxyphenyl)-2-propanyl]acetamide (AZD-5423).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1239-45</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1517/13543776.2013.820706</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A crystalline form (form B) of the novel glucocorticoid receptor agonist 2,2,2-trifluoro-N-[(1R,2S)-1-{[1-(4-fluorophenyl)-1H-indazol-5-yl]oxy}-1-(3-methoxyphenyl)-2-propanyl]acetamide (AZD-5423) and its use alone or in combination for the treatment of asthma and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease are claimed. This form of AZD-5423 is better absorbed than Form A drug after inhalation. Two effective large-scale syntheses of AZD-5423 are described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
